    stepID: D5_DetectiveAdvice
    speakerName: The Detective
    personality: 6
    lineText: 
    displayDuration: 5.7
    lineVariants:
    - requiredLevel: 0
      lineText: We know the corpse fired the gun. Perhaps begin with the deeply suspicious fact that the corpse was supposed to be dead.
    - requiredLevel: 2
      lineText: Start at the impossible outcome and work backward. The AI attacks after the winning shot, so trace every call between resolving that shot and declaring victory.
